# Operation Teatime (ahtUrhgan 28), the quest's own var at the completion: a PUP of level 50, this quest accepted,
# OperationTeatimeProgress 3 and Quest[6][28]Prog 1 (GMs). Caedarva Mire's qm10: 15; finished: npcUtil.completeQuest
# (the Puppetry Churidars, the progress var 0, completed). npcUtil.completeQuest does no cleanup:
# Quest[6][28]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=CaedarvaMire pos=474.8,-31.8,75.5 job=PUP lvl=50
quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
quest AhtUrhgan.TheWaywardAutomaton completed
quest AhtUrhgan.OperationTeatime accepted
charvar OperationTeatimeProgress 3
charvar Quest[6][28]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger qm10                            # accepted, OperationTeatimeProgress 3: 15
finish                                  # the Puppetry Churidars; the progress var 0; completed, Prog kept
trigger qm10                            # completed: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
